title: "Shimline: evidence-native bookkeeping automation engine for QuickBooks Online"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Madaan
    given-names: Aryan
    email: aryanmadaan@gmail.com
repository-code: "https://github.com/wig1-max/shimline-bookkeeping-engine"
license: Apache-2.0
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-09-19
keywords:
  - bookkeeping automation
  - QuickBooks Online
  - double-entry accounting
  - reconciliation
  - GST/HST
  - FastAPI
abstract: >-
  An open-source bookkeeping automation engine that pulls QuickBooks Online data,
  reconstructs a double-entry ledger, runs deterministic accounting checks, turns
  defects into human-approved correction proposals, writes them back idempotently,
  verifies them by read-back and reconciles the result.
